  lines:
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: ' "Testing testing..."'
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: '"Is this thing on?... Yeah, it is."'
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: '"I have to say this is a pretty cool gift. I''m impressed."'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"Of course it is! What do you mean!?"'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"It''s your first day as a profiler. You need a recorder, don''t
      you?"'
  - npcType: 5
    dialogueText: '"And it costed him a lot of money, you know."'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"Hey, babe... It''s fine. It''s a special occasion."'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"It''s Claire''s birthday after all!"'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"I will always be there for you s..."'
  - npcType: 7
    dialogueText: '"Seriously, can we not make this a whole thing right now?"'
